# Example LOPNOR inference menu.
# The parser reads the first value on each non-comment line.

DemoProp                 case name
3                        blade number
0.82                     blade tip radius [m]
0.205                    hub radius [m]
8                        blade pitch angle [deg]
bladeGeom.txt            blade geometry file
2560                     RPM
0                        propeller shaft pitch angle [deg]
0                        propeller shaft yaw angle [deg]
41.71                    free-stream velocity [m/s]
AUTO                     advance ratio J, or AUTO to compute from V, RPM, and radius
mics.txt                 microphone file
